 "name": "Cursed Energy Slash",
 "type": "feat",
 "img": "modules/jjk5e/icons/feat.svg",
 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Cursed Imbuement or Cursed Enhancement</em></p>\n<p>As an action while holding a weapon that deals slashing damage, you can spend 5 Cursed Energy to make a huge cursed energy slash. You make all creatures in a 15 ft cone or a 30 ft line make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes the weapon’s normal damage + additional damage dice equal to a single die of the weapon times your Cursed Energy modifier in necrotic damage. On a success, they take half as much (Eg. Greatsword with a +3 CE modifier would be 2d6 + 3d6 necrotic damage).</p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
